# MCP local state: stored projects, the compiled-engine bundle, the audio
# analysis cache and idempotency records. All of it is derived or personal —
# projects are a user's own work, and the caches rebuild themselves.
.flarent/

# Render-server runtime state: uploaded assets, the persisted job table and the
# symlink tree handed to Remotion's bundler. Personal or derived, never source.
# In production this lives outside the checkout entirely (FLARENT_UPLOAD_DIR,
# FLARENT_OUT_DIR, FLARENT_DATA_DIR).
.flarent-data/
